; claude: compound documents (see
; docs/claude_notes/plans/plan_gui_teaching.md, phase 10): what a part
; of a document has to be able to do (Component), and a document made
; of parts, nested (Compound) -- Andrew's insets, OLE's objects,
; OpenDoc's parts, in two small modules.
;
; It knows no kind of part: a sheet, a text, a picture are the
; applications', and it reaches them only through the protocol. A
; private library, installed as part of elm_playground.
(library
 (name appkit_embed)
 (package elm_playground)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries
   elm_playground ; a part draws Playground shapes, and reads the computer
   gui ; Widget.box, the rectangle a part is given
 )
)
